{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Welcome to Void Authority \u2013 The Universe\u2019s Most Dangerous Desk Job.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the lone inspector at a dusty border checkpoint orbiting a forgotten world, you\u2019ll face aliens with stories, secrets, and suspicious cargo. Will you uphold interstellar law, take a bribe, or let rebels slip through to fuel a quiet revolution?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871110/extras/35d87253e1efa7c20988cb67c4593ed7.avif?t=1753723527\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871110/extras/e7461405f417618c086f9774c5d43350.avif?t=1753723527\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871110/extras/2946d52bf008b19ac6af07a92605a8d7.avif?t=1753723527\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u00a0</strong>Check papers, scan contraband, and decide who gets to cross the stars in this roguelike document-inspection game where every decision shifts the fate of a galaxy on the brink.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871110/extras/4f8541dfe069487d67bfcf6f6b602713.poster.avif?t=1753723527\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871110/extras/4f8541dfe069487d67bfcf6f6b602713.webm?t=1753723527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871110/extras/4f8541dfe069487d67bfcf6f6b602713.mp4?t=1753723527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871110/extras/db46ca13676381c1195cd35f5dd3998d.avif?t=1753723527\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Each run begins in a new outpost with shifting laws, factions, and species to contend with. Upgrade your tools, unlock shortcuts, and make judgment calls that ripple across future inspections\u2014all as you climb the ranks and inch closer to the galaxy\u2019s looming crisis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871110/extras/3ea25d0f3f9df7e6b1be42b235fe3872.avif?t=1753723527\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Colorful aliens and vibrant sci-fi contraptions bring your dusty space office to life</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871110/extras/d38361d2228c95ec58d272a791213a73.poster.avif?t=1753723527\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871110/extras/d38361d2228c95ec58d272a791213a73.webm?t=1753723527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871110/extras/006b6365d92b55c629b5c2b18e5e9ca3.avif?t=1753723527\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Who you let through changes who holds power tomorrow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871110/extras/ec5ff1c739042907b40d15d86c5c297f.avif?t=1753723527\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Use X-ray scanners, Seal Verifiers and other unique tools to correctly process intergalactic travelers\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871110/extras/c606a022c317666829d21f85a819ab38.avif?t=1753723527\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871110/extras/a07e9af38695db31da1753fbe4b82885.avif?t=1753723527\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A darkly comedic look at bureaucracy, corruption, and what it means to do your job when the universe is falling apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have a universe of paperwork to file, inspector. The line is waiting.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3871110?t=1753723527","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871110/0da75199e11715d95b3dc8d1e1f55eeb8e029e9d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753723527","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871110/1d82b5cb6c1099a51912e33f38ce3d9c2cae2d8c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753723527","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871110/1d82b5cb6c1099a51912e33f38ce3d9c2cae2d8c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753723527","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Welcome to Void Authority \u2013 The Universe\u2019s Most Dangerous Desk Job.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the lone inspector at a dusty border checkpoint orbiting a forgotten world, you\u2019ll face aliens with stori